  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個模組將藪貓加入你的世界！</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們喜歡獵捕雞和兔子，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用生魚或雞肉/兔肉馴服牠們<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們會自然生成於莽原，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">還會發出可愛的叫聲！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HTh-l2GupS8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模型由 u/SociopathyKathy 製作</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fMinecraft%252fcomments%252fkh6cm7%252fi_got_bored_and_decided_to_make_a_caracal%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.reddit.com/r/Minecraft/comments/kh6cm7/i_got_bored_and_decided_to_make_a_caracal/</a></span></p>",
